{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 3, :comments ["<b>Beautiful height</b> — the district of the third Naphath, on the analogy of one who winnows with a winnowing shovel [רחת]. And its being a branch [סעיף] or from מתנופת has no sense." "<b>Mount Zion</b> — in the north of Jerusalem." "<b>Great king</b> — great, like \"over all his great house\" (Genesis 24:2), and it is David, the city of David's grace."], :book :psalms, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 48, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Psalms -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/tehilim"] ["Wikisource Mikraot Gedolot" "http://en.wikisource.org/wiki/Mikraot_Gedolot/"] ["Tanakh, Venice, 1617-1619" "https://dlib.rsl.ru/viewer/01007514045#?page=4"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:31:07.400835800Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}